flowchart TD
    A[Approved labeled dataset] --> B[Define target and error costs]
    B --> C[Train / validation / test split]
    C --> D[Fit preprocessing on training data only]
    D --> E{Task}
    E -- Continuous target --> F[Linear Regression]
    F --> F1[Ridge: L2 shrinkage]
    F --> F2[Lasso: L1 shrinkage and feature selection]
    F1 --> G[MAE, RMSE, R2; inspect residuals]
    F2 --> G
    E -- Class labels --> H[SVM: margin and kernel]
    E -- Class labels --> I[KNN: distance and k]
    E -- Class labels --> J[Decision Tree]
    J --> J1[Random Forest: aggregate randomized trees]
    H --> K[Confusion matrix and per-class metrics]
    I --> K
    J1 --> K
    G --> L[Compare validation evidence]
    K --> L
    L --> M[Final test evaluation and documented conclusion]
